; winter_trial.room - the winter song trials (docs/maps/README.md), left to right.
; Tested by tests/scenes/world/rooms/trials/winter_trial_test.gd. Base movement,
; a single jump.
;
; 1. The bottom of the well (design 02 section 8, Inverno Espacial 2): a well
;    too wide to jump, full of water, with a low passage at the foot of its
;    near wall. Redoma played at the edge holds the water out of its shell;
;    Ivo drops down the dry side and into the passage, and the water comes
;    back in behind him as the shell shrinks.
; 2. Playing inside the gale (Inverno Logico 1): a squall (col 46) gusts across
;    the near bank with calms shorter than six notes, so any song played in
;    it breaks. The drawbridge's hinge (col 51) is beyond Soltar's reach from
;    the calm ground before it. Redoma played at the edge of the squall opens
;    a shelter; inside it Ivo walks in and plays Soltar, and the bridge falls
;    across the chasm. The other way round, the wind breaks Soltar.

[room]
origin = 0, -16

